      "text": "God planted a garden eastward in Eden, Gen. 2:8 (2:15; Moses 3:8; Abr. 5:8). God sent him forth from the garden of Eden, Gen. 3:23. not as the land of Egypt … a garden of herbs, Deut. 11:10. as a garden that hath no water, Isa. 1:30. Eden, and her desert like the garden of the Lord, Isa. 51:3 (2 Ne. 8:3). plant gardens, and eat the fruit, Jer. 29:5 (29:28; Amos 9:14). Thou hast been in Eden the garden of God, Ezek. 28:13. land that was desolate is become like the garden of Eden, Ezek. 36:35. land is as the garden of Eden before them, Joel 2:3.",
